 begin="01:21.440" end="01:21.680">fly </span><span begin="01:21.680" end="01:21.880">it' </span><span begin="01:21.880" end="01:22.130">though</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.130" end="01:23.380"><span begin="01:22.130" end="01:22.310">I'm </span><span begin="01:22.310" end="01:22.500">lyin' </span><span begin="01:22.500" end="01:22.690">down </span><span begin="01:22.690" end="01:22.870">thinkin' </span><span begin="01:22.870" end="01:23.050">'bout </span><span begin="01:23.050" end="01:23.380">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.380" end="01:25.260" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="01:23.380" end="01:23.750">(Ooh' </span><span begin="01:23.750" end="01:24.130">no' </span><span begin="01:24.130" end="01:24.760">no' </span><span begin="01:24.760" end="01:25.260">no)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.390" end="01:26.570"><span begin="01:25.390" end="01:25.640">I've </span><span begin="01:25.640" end="01:25.830">been </span><span begin="01:25.830" end="01:26.010">thinkin' </span><span begin="01:26.010" end="01:26.250">'bout </span><span begin="01:26.250" end="01:26.570">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.750" end="01:28.450" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background"><span begin="01:26.750" end="01:27.140">(You </span><span begin="01:27.140" end="01:27.570">know' </span><span begin="01:27.570" end="01:28.000">know' </span><span begin="01:28.000" end="01:28.450">know)</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.810" end="01:30.560"><span begin="01:28.810" end="01:29.010">I've </span><span begin="01:29.010" end="01:29.250">been </span><span begin="01:29.250" end="01:29.510">thinkin' </span><span begin="01:29.510" end="01:29.880">'bout </span><span begin="01:29.880" end="01:30.560">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.560" end="01:33.380"><span begin="01:30.560" end="01:30.820">Do </span><span begin="01:30.820" end="01:31.070">you </span><span begin="01:31.070" end="01:31.500">think </span><span begin="01: